<title>SINGAPORE: Thai's Bangchak raises runs after cut back-source.</title>
<headline>Thai's Bangchak raises runs after cut back-source.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Refinery runs at Thailand's Bangchak Petroleum Plc were up to 115,000 barrels per day (bpd) this week after they were cut in early July to 100,000 bpd, a refinery source said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
